# SaveChanges

- DbContext inherits `MicroserviceDbContext`.
- Only `SaveChangesAsync(cancellationToken)`.
- Do not set `CreatedAt` / `CreatedBy` / `Version` — Common interceptors own them.

```csharp
await context.SaveChangesAsync(cancellationToken);
```
